      "content": "Amazon CloudWatch monitors your Amazon Web Services resources and the applications you run on AWS in real time. You can use CloudWatch to collect and track metrics, create alarms that send notifications, and automatically react to changes in your AWS resources. CloudWatch provides a reliable, scalable, and flexible monitoring solution for your cloud infrastructure.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amazon Web Services",
